OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely cloudy with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain, this becoming more persistent
OL,7,Fand quite heavy at times, especially
OL,8,Fover western Fife, Stirlingshire and
OL,9,FPerthshire. The Angus coast should see
OL,10,Fjust light patchy rain and drier
OL,11,Fperiods though it will be windy there.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with further rain at
OL,14,Ftimes, heavier over western areas at
OL,15,Ffirst but the rain becoming more
OL,16,Fpersistent across Angus overnight
OL,17,Fwhile turning lighter in the west.
OL,18,
OL,19,CWednesday:FMainly cloudy with further
OL,20,Frain at times, though it will become
OL,21,Fdrier and perhaps a bit brighter later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
