OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday mainly dry, sunny. Chance of
OL,7,Fpersistent heavy rain on Friday, then
OL,8,Fbright with sunny intervals and a few
OL,9,Fshowers on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
